 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? One way is to record short videos of yourself introducing yourself and talking about something you like. Watching them later helps you become more aware of your own speech. record yourself in private, so it' risk free. You can even keep the video turned off and just read the text out loud. Another technique is chain talking. Pick a partner and agree to start each other's thoughts. You both build each other's confidence. That's very common. Listening to recordings helps you get used it. It does. Or try learning a song in a new language. Singing it ties your mouth and voice to the new language in a fun way.",
